---
import ResidenceLayout from "../../../layouts/ResidenceLayout.astro";
import ResponsivePhoto from "../../../components/ResponsivePhoto.astro";
import { frederick, frederickPhotos } from "../../../data/residences/frederick";
---

<ResidenceLayout
  residence={frederick}
  title="Arrival & map · Frederick Cottage | Mt Cottages"
  description="How to arrive at Frederick Cottage in Marietta: what to share, what to expect, and how the home stays private."
  eyebrow="Frederick Cottage · Arrival & map"
  heading="Arrive without guesswork."
  lede="Know the setting before day one, plus a short confirmation checklist — so arrival feels planned, not improvised."
>
  <section class="section section--paper">
    <div class="site-width editorial">
      <div class="stack reveal">
        <h2>Recognize the setting.</h2>
        <p>The backyard photo shows the home's outdoor side: lawn, picket fence, patio seating, and mature trees in a residential Marietta setting. Street-level recognition happens through pre-arrival details. Exact addresses stay private — arrival details travel through the inquiry and pre-arrival messages, never the public site.</p>
        <ol class="step-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
          <li><strong>Share</strong><p>Dates, household, vehicles, pets, and access needs in the inquiry.</p></li>
          <li><strong>Confirm</strong><p>Parking, keys/entry, and arrival window before day one.</p></li>
          <li><strong>Settle</strong><p>Walk kitchen, laundry, thermostat, and trash placement on arrival evening.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <figure class="reveal reveal--image"><ResponsivePhoto {...frederickPhotos.exterior} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 45vw" /></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-width split">
      <div class="stack reveal">
        <h2>Map context, privacy-safe.</h2>
        <p>Frederick Cottage sits in Marietta, Ohio — where the Muskingum meets the Ohio River — with a historic downtown and the daily services a longer stay needs. No street address, map pin, or directions link is published here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq reveal">
        <details open><summary>Where do I park?</summary><p>Parking varies by home and arrangement. Confirm spaces, street rules, and winter notes in the pre-arrival message.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What time can I arrive?</summary><p>Arrival windows are arranged per stay. Share travel timing early so the team can plan keys and walkthrough.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Who do I call if I am delayed?</summary><p>Use the resident support channel provided for the stay — details arrive with the arrangement, not on the public site.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ResidenceLayout>
